7. **Coverage note** — no source-level test places a genexp inside an *eager* comprehension's element (e.g. `[list(y for y in x) for x in xs]`). The scope machinery is identical to the covered genexp-in-genexp cases (`genexp-nesting-and-call-arguments-test`), so this is a gap in witness, not in mechanism. Severity: observation. Fix: optional one-liner if a later slice touches comprehensions anyway.
